{# Canonical provider-identity block. Single source of truth for how the
   provider's legal identity is presented across all legal pages (LSSI-CE
   Art. 10, GDPR Art. 13). Add a field here and it propagates everywhere.

   Accepts:
   - identityEmail   — mailto address to show. Default: site.email.support.
   - identityHeading — optional lead-in paragraph rendered above the block.
                       Default: none (no lead-in).

   Missing values are intentionally OMITTED, never defaulted:
   - Tax ID line renders only when site.legal.taxId is non-empty.
   - Address line renders only when site.legal.address.isSet — a missing
     address must be visibly missing, never faked as "Barcelona, Spain". #}
{% set identityEmail = identityEmail or site.email.support %}
{% if identityHeading %}
  <p>{{ identityHeading }}</p>
{% endif %}
<p>
  <strong>Entity:</strong> {{ site.legal.entity }}<br>
  {% if site.legal.taxId %}<strong>Tax ID (NIF):</strong> {{ site.legal.taxId }}<br>{% endif %}
  <strong>Registered as:</strong> autónomo in Spain<br>
  {% if site.legal.address.isSet %}<strong>Address:</strong> {{ site.legal.address.oneLine }}<br>{% endif %}
  <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ identityEmail }}">{{ identityEmail }}</a><br>
  <strong>Website:</strong> {{ site.domain }}
</p>
